epos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"00ff00","default":false,"description":"赏金任务"},{"id":11374919927,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpf-A9w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11374970479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpgBGbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11378467382,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpjWiNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/practice","name":"practice","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:37:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T00:02:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: Lack of Account Lockout\n\n**难度:** Easy | **奖励:** $10 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: Lack of Account Lockout。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/106/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34","id":4773645746,"node_id":"I_kwDOTGNm188AAAABHIgNsg","number":34,"title":"[BUG] Cache Poisoning — $25","user":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","id":288065324,"node_id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288065324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11370827435,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpcEOqw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/honeypot-task","name":"honeypot-task","color":"ffa500","default":false,"description":"蜜罐任务 - 提交修复触发评测"},{"id":11370827640,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpcEPeA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"00ff00","default":false,"description":"赏金任务"},{"id":11374918082,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpf95wg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/medium","name":"medium","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":17,"created_at":"2026-06-30T04:19:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T23:26:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## BUG: Cache Poisoning\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nCDN cache poisoning via unkeyed headers — attacker can serve malicious content to other users\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11/labels{/name}","comments_url":"ht