over over the email address of the group admin\n6. Hover over the email address of the member (Not admin)\n\n## Expected Result:\nTooltip with email address of the member is displayed when hovering just like when hovering over admin\n\n## Actual Result:\nTooltip with email address is not displayed when hovering over group member just like when hovering over group admins\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/340bec63-0c25-468f-9dc8-7fee832bc21f\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7178138\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065147761627713217\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065147761627713217</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065147761627713217</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93322/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZcashCommunityGrants/zcashcommunitygrants/issues/153","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZcashCommunityGrants/zcashcommunitygrants","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZcashCommunityGrants/zcashcommunitygrants/issues/153/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZcashCommunityGrants/zcashcommunitygrants/issues/153/co